    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d642">

                <pb facs="0796" n="688" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg688"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-10-04"><hi rendition="#italic">October 4,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham requests further particulars and asks what the Turkish Government
                    claims, what ground the arrest was based on, and whether the men were arrested
                    because they violated some law or order of the Turkish Government by
                    returning.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
